# vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py

Registers deepagents "harness profiles" for OpenAI-compatible models: a system-prompt suffix (the investigation floor) that the deepagents library appends to every agent's system prompt for that provider. Stage-specific and per-model overrides are supported by structure, but both override tables are empty in this version.

Source: `vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py` (lines 1-117)
Executor: code (registers model-facing text)
Called from: `options/graph_builder.py:401` register_vvah_harness_profiles (every graph build); `options/graph_builder.py:155` stage_profile_suffix

## Prompt fragments

// prompt-src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:33-36
_READ_BEFORE_ANSWERING {
  Constraints {
    "Never describe code you have not opened."
    "Reading one file and generalising from it is the single most common way this task is failed: the answer is graded on what is actually in the repo, not on what a repo of this kind usually contains."
    "Before you commit to any answer, open every file your answer depends on. If you have named a path, you must have read it."
    "If a tool returned nothing, that is a fact about your query, not a fact about the repo — re-query differently rather than concluding the thing is absent."
  }
}

// prompt-src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:38-41
_PARALLEL_TOOL_CALLS {
  Constraints {
    "Decide every file and lookup you need, then issue those calls together in one batch rather than one at a time."
    "Reading five files is five calls in parallel, not five sequential turns."
    "Only serialise a call whose arguments genuinely depend on a previous result."
    "Never guess a parameter or use a placeholder to avoid a lookup."
  }
}

// prompt-src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:43-46
_REFLECT_IN_WRITING {
  Constraints {
    "After each batch of tool results, state to yourself what you now know that you did not before, and what is still unverified. Let that decide the next batch."
    "Do not proceed to the final answer while a load-bearing claim is still unverified."
  }
}

// prompt-src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:53-56
_ENUMERATE_DO_NOT_SUMMARISE {
  Constraints {
    "When the output schema asks for a list, the list is the deliverable and its length is part of the answer."
    "One broad item that folds several distinct cases together is a worse answer than several narrow items, and anything you fold in is lost — nothing downstream can recover it."
    "Exhaust the cases you have evidence for before you stop."
    "Do not stop at the first few because they feel representative, and do not merge two cases because they happen to share a file."
  }
}

// prompt-src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:48-68
// preserved: three further fragments are defined but referenced nowhere (grep of the package finds no use outside this file): _REFLECT_WITHOUT_WRITING (lines 48-51, "do not write that stocktake out"), _BEAT_THE_CLOCK (lines 58-63, "Shorten the path to the answer, never the answer."), _DO_NOT_NARRATE (lines 65-68, "do not restate, quote or paraphrase code you have read — cite it as `path:line` and move on"). They reach no model in this version.

// src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:70-77
_INVESTIGATION_FLOOR = join with blank lines [_READ_BEFORE_ANSWERING, _PARALLEL_TOOL_CALLS, _REFLECT_IN_WRITING, _ENUMERATE_DO_NOT_SUMMARISE]

## Registration

// src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:79-87
PROFILED_PROVIDERS = ["openai"]   // the floor applies to the OpenAI-compatible provider only; Anthropic models get no vvah suffix here
_PER_MODEL_SUFFIX = {}   // empty in this version
_STAGE_SUFFIX = {}   // empty in this version, so stage_profile_suffix always returns null

// src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:93-96
fn stage_profile_suffix(stage, registry_key):executor=code {
  return _STAGE_SUFFIX[stage || ""][registry_key], or null   // null leaves the registered suffix in place
}

// src: vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/profiles.py:104-117
fn register_vvah_harness_profiles():executor=code {
  under a process lock; runs once per process (later calls return at once)
  profile = HarnessProfile(system_prompt_suffix=_INVESTIGATION_FLOOR)
  for each key in PROFILED_PROVIDERS, register_harness_profile(key, profile)   // external: deepagents.profiles
  for each key in sorted(every model key named in _STAGE_SUFFIX, minus keys in _PER_MODEL_SUFFIX), register_harness_profile(key, profile)
  for each (key, suffix) in _PER_MODEL_SUFFIX, register_harness_profile(key, HarnessProfile(system_prompt_suffix=suffix))
}
